cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "falsify-inspect: PRML pre-registration adapter for Inspect AI eval logs"
abstract: >-
  A Python package that wraps the Inspect AI evaluation framework with
  Pre-Registered ML Manifest (PRML) v0.1 hashing, allowing eval claim
  thresholds to be cryptographically committed before a run and
  verified against the eval log afterwards.
